01:04:34.380 --> 01:04:34.860
Of course.

01:04:35.710 --> 01:04:35.830
Frank?

01:04:36.880 --> 01:04:39.750
Well, son, looks like you went out and got a packet of trouble for yourself.

01:04:40.760 --> 01:04:42.640
You've been very kind about it, Mr. Hunsaker.

01:04:42.910 --> 01:04:44.110
Give Susie credit for that.

01:04:44.480 --> 01:04:46.180
I took her word there was nothing to the smear.

01:04:46.890 --> 01:04:49.960
As a matter of fact, I'll have plenty to say about smears on my show today.

01:04:51.050 --> 01:04:51.910
And that's why I'd...

01:04:52.510 --> 01:04:54.150
Well, I'd like you a personal assurance, too.

01:04:55.670 --> 01:04:57.830
Mr. Hunsaker, there is nothing to the smear.

01:04:58.010 --> 01:04:59.410
You are my sincere word.

01:05:00.120 --> 01:05:04.900
I'll buy that. Now, you do me a favor. Be good to my kid sister.

01:05:05.400 --> 01:05:07.260
Yeah, she's had a lot of trouble for a kid.

01:05:08.640 --> 01:05:11.240
Susie has her girlish secrets, but in her heart of hearts,

01:05:11.380 --> 01:05:13.840
I imagine Dallas, she fancies you in an uncommon way.

01:05:15.280 --> 01:05:20.060
Now, how about you? Not just, uh, well, not just Tom canning around, I hope.

01:05:20.260 --> 01:05:21.480
J.J., Steve is not...

01:05:21.480 --> 01:05:22.500
Now, take it easy, Susie.

01:05:24.300 --> 01:05:27.120
Steve wouldn't be much of a man if he didn't understand my concern, now, would you?

01:05:28.300 --> 01:05:29.040
No, I wouldn't.

01:05:30.830 --> 01:05:33.590
Serious as a deacon. I like it. I like it fine.

01:05:34.380 --> 01:05:36.480
In a world of all rags and bones, I like it.

01:05:38.460 --> 01:05:39.340
Now, you take Sidney here.

01:05:41.560 --> 01:05:45.250
If Sidney ever got anywhere near Susie, I'd take a baseball bat.

01:05:45.370 --> 01:05:47.040
Kick it over his head.

01:05:50.680 --> 01:05:52.500
Sidney lives so much in morrow twilight

01:05:52.500 --> 01:05:55.390
that when I told him you were coming here today, he predicted disaster.

01:05:56.160 --> 01:05:57.260
Said you wouldn't take my favor.

01:05:58.410 --> 01:05:59.970
He said you'd chew up the job and spit it...

01:06:00.000 --> 01:06:02.180
right back in my face. Any truth in that?

01:06:03.500 --> 01:06:05.100
Since you bring it up, Mr. Hansiger,

01:06:06.120 --> 01:06:07.780
and now if I can amplify... Don't amplify.

01:06:09.630 --> 01:06:11.670
Steve would like to thank you for this favor.

01:06:12.040 --> 01:06:13.720
You don't listen very good, do you, Frank?

01:06:14.120 --> 01:06:15.700
J.J. just said to keep your mouth shut.

01:06:16.410 --> 01:06:17.910
Don't you think it's about time you shut yours?

01:06:17.910 --> 01:06:20.050
I didn't hear you. Who are you to tell a man like Frank D'Angelo?

01:06:20.310 --> 01:06:21.770
Look, Steve, this isn't important.

01:06:22.530 --> 01:06:23.690
Does he have to be here?

01:06:24.830 --> 01:06:28.990
Why? Has he bothered you before? Who's to you?

01:06:29.150 --> 01:06:29.810
Well, now, look, son.

01:06:30.000 --> 01:06:36.340
people tell me i'm a very gifted man but i still can't see around corners now just what exactly are

01:06:36.340 --> 01:06:41.140
you so hot about i mean i know it's a difficult thing to be an artist in this crudest of all

01:06:41.140 --> 01:06:46.790
possible worlds but look i'm not here as an artist i'm here as an average joe happens to

01:06:46.790 --> 01:06:56.920
love your sister well just be careful you don't knock her off her feet frankly son i lost you on

