01:07:18.380 --> 01:07:21.900
Look, let's forget about dogs and cats and all that pseudo-literary junk.

01:07:22.340 --> 01:07:23.740
I'm gonna lay it right on the line.

01:07:24.060 --> 01:07:25.900
What about that ruckus in my office this afternoon?

01:07:26.260 --> 01:07:27.180
You were there, Frank.

01:07:27.420 --> 01:07:29.040
We're recording the St. Dallas here.

01:07:29.180 --> 01:07:29.960
J.J. was responsible.

01:07:30.000 --> 01:07:31.320
He's responsible for the Elwell smear.

01:07:31.460 --> 01:07:32.240
Now, don't go wild, Sue.

01:07:32.240 --> 01:07:34.400
Wild, take a look at them and tell me who's wild.

01:07:34.560 --> 01:07:35.000
Well, what about it?

01:07:35.040 --> 01:07:37.300
Well, Steve was overexcited. He didn't mean excited.

01:07:37.300 --> 01:07:37.940
Well, how did you mean it?

01:07:38.060 --> 01:07:39.100
Look, I was in my...

01:07:39.100 --> 01:07:39.720
Quiet, all of you!

01:07:40.080 --> 01:07:42.460
Susie, sit down. This requires investigation.

01:07:42.760 --> 01:07:46.650
How did you mean it?

01:07:47.980 --> 01:07:48.840
Come on, come on. I'm waiting.

01:07:49.870 --> 01:07:52.830
Look, I don't take kindly to you and Falco teaching me ethics.

01:07:53.340 --> 01:07:54.780
