01:08:50.880 --> 01:08:54.620
It's out of you, Dallas, but perhaps Susie may not care to air her views in public.

01:09:01.310 --> 01:09:03.630
Susie is always as free to say anything she wants.

01:09:04.640 --> 01:09:07.420
Go on, dear. Say exactly what's on your mind, dear.

01:09:07.500 --> 01:09:10.380
