To me, and a lot of people like me,

01:10:15.390 --> 01:10:18.920
your slimy scandal and your phony patriotics,

01:10:19.100 --> 01:10:21.260
to me, Mr. Hunsecker, you're a national disgrace.

01:10:28.240 --> 01:10:29.980
Son, I don't realize shooting mosquitoes with...

