01:12:28.590 --> 01:12:29.070
I'll change him.

01:12:29.150 --> 01:12:29.910
Forget it, forget it.

01:12:32.360 --> 01:12:34.540
We're on the verge of a farce, a real farce.

01:12:34.850 --> 01:12:37.700
As I see it, if Susie would have stood behind him today,

01:12:37.840 --> 01:12:38.900
he might have proved a threat.

01:12:39.160 --> 01:12:41.340
But since primarily he's wedded to his work,

01:12:41.500 --> 01:12:43.020
he's not going to be able to take it.

01:12:43.740 --> 01:12:45.920
Stop tinkering, pal. That horseradish won't jump a fence.

